    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gehenna Sticks University, professor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get a job at the prestigious Sticks University of Hell and graduate two students safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instruct them in numerous ways, including overtime, vigil, verbal abuse, Rejek, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one will reject the professor's orders, but be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angry postgraduate demons will try to kill you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the Member of people produced</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by Eugene Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration: Halla Tangerine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI &amp; Logo &amp; PV: Chibinho</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spine: Gammanju</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgana Station: Smile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith Station: Park Seoho</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recording &amp; Directing: Plus diction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game specs</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Visual Novel, Fostering, Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time: 4 hours~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configuration</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two standing characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 CG illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 ending</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Users can direct the work of two graduate students for a total of 25 weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Users can make graduate students earn money or teach classes to raise statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can direct up to five tasks each week, and at the end of the tasks, a special event will be held that will increase your favorability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Users can have a relationship through a special event with graduate students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check the ending at the end of the 25th week or if you fill the graduate student's favorability to the maximum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check eight different endings depending on the user's choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to control game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Click: Line Progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl: Skip the line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter : Line Progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc : End of game, skip video</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This work contains some shocking scenes or horror-inducing content. \u203b</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gehenna Sticks University, professor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get a job at the prestigious Sticks University of Hell and graduate two students safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instruct them in numerous ways, including overtime, vigil, verbal abuse, Rejek, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one will reject the professor's orders, but be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angry postgraduate demons will try to kill you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the Member of people produced</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by Eugene Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration: Halla Tangerine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI &amp; Logo &amp; PV: Chibinho</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spine: Gammanju</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgana Station: Smile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith Station: Park Seoho</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recording &amp; Directing: Plus diction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game specs</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Visual Novel, Fostering, Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time: 4 hours~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configuration</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two standing characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 CG illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 ending</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Users can direct the work of two graduate students for a total of 25 weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Users can make graduate students earn money or teach classes to raise statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can direct up to five tasks each week, and at the end of the tasks, a special event will be held that will increase your favorability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Users can have a relationship through a special event with graduate students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check the ending at the end of the 25th week or if you fill the graduate student's favorability to the maximum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check eight different endings depending on the user's choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to control game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Click: Line Progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl: Skip the line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter : Line Progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc : End of game, skip video</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This work contains some shocking scenes or horror-inducing content. \u203b</p>",
